    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skeletons are invading, and your only defense is a toaster and a chicken! Embark on a whimsical adventure through a land plagued by pesky skeletons! Uncover weird and wacky weapon synergies to fight back against the bony baddies. Along the way, you'll gather a rag-tag group of heroes who will aid you on your mission- will you have the guts to stop the necromancer's plans and save the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8f4f2c3a085c60d7bc72983e7092bd77.poster.avif?t=1740403507\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8f4f2c3a085c60d7bc72983e7092bd77.webm?t=1740403507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an arsenal of ONE MILLION different weapon\u00a0combinations, from explosive toast to homing robot chickens, and customize your loadout to suit your playstyle as you wreak havoc on your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8a6d84130cb6920218f547a3f61df4be.poster.avif?t=1740403507\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8a6d84130cb6920218f547a3f61df4be.webm?t=1740403507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit up to four friends\u00a0to join your quest to defeat the necromancer, or measure yourself\u00a0by playing alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/52a6d9091b71456ae9e4c9fb4df9ad35.poster.avif?t=1740403507\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/52a6d9091b71456ae9e4c9fb4df9ad35.webm?t=1740403507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform your train into a formidable base of operations for the friends you meet along the way, buy upgrades, decorate your train, and prepare your next mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8d768345967c63f41ac1b1d822db00b2.poster.avif?t=1740403507\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8d768345967c63f41ac1b1d822db00b2.webm?t=1740403507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Dive into procedurally generated levels filled with challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills and adaptability as you strive to overcome the ever-growing threats that await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skeletons are invading, and your only defense is a toaster and a chicken! Embark on a whimsical adventure through a land plagued by pesky skeletons! Uncover weird and wacky weapon synergies to fight back against the bony baddies. Along the way, you'll gather a rag-tag group of heroes who will aid you on your mission- will you have the guts to stop the necromancer's plans and save the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8f4f2c3a085c60d7bc72983e7092bd77.poster.avif?t=1740403507\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8f4f2c3a085c60d7bc72983e7092bd77.webm?t=1740403507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an arsenal of ONE MILLION different weapon\u00a0combinations, from explosive toast to homing robot chickens, and customize your loadout to suit your playstyle as you wreak havoc on your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8a6d84130cb6920218f547a3f61df4be.poster.avif?t=1740403507\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8a6d84130cb6920218f547a3f61df4be.webm?t=1740403507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit up to four friends\u00a0to join your quest to defeat the necromancer, or measure yourself\u00a0by playing alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/52a6d9091b71456ae9e4c9fb4df9ad35.poster.avif?t=1740403507\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/52a6d9091b71456ae9e4c9fb4df9ad35.webm?t=1740403507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform your train into a formidable base of operations for the friends you meet along the way, buy upgrades, decorate your train, and prepare your next mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8d768345967c63f41ac1b1d822db00b2.poster.avif?t=1740403507\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951650/extras/8d768345967c63f41ac1b1d822db00b2.webm?t=1740403507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Dive into procedurally generated levels filled with challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills and adaptability as you strive to overcome the ever-growing threats that await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
